{"unit_id":"7gzgn__dsh-restart-planner#card-zh","repo":"7gzgn/dsh-restart-planner","commit":"b115ddb47fcad13c2581d359cd0fd827e9db3f76","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-restart-planner 是一个面向 DSH 的宿主重启插件，通过 self_restart 工具安排稍后重启，并提供命令行入口。它先计算重启目标和启动命令，再交给独立 helper 执行；排程会等待回复发送及会话目录静默。用户可以查询状态、取消排程、预演计划或在重启后自动向原会话投递继续提示。插件还支持确认重启时机、设置等待参数并保存执行报告，适合需要重载 DSH 或自动恢复工作会话的场景。需要本机 Node.js 与 DSH；无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:448-459","lib/core.js:293-359","bin/dsh-restart-planner.mjs:61-80"]}
{"unit_id":"7gzgn__dsh-restart-planner#card-en","repo":"7gzgn/dsh-restart-planner","commit":"b115ddb47fcad13c2581d359cd0fd827e9db3f76","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-restart-planner schedules DSH restarts through a tool or CLI. It waits for session writes, then delegates relaunch to a helper. Users can inspect status, cancel a plan, preview a restart, and queue a prompt to resume the original session. Requires local Node.js and DSH.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:448-459","lib/core.js:293-359","bin/dsh-restart-planner.mjs:61-80"]}
